6. Supports a configuration option for enforcing strict path length checks to accommodate systems with stringent security policies.

The function returns the updated path on success or `NULL` with an error code indicating the nature of the failure. Edge cases such as empty strings, excessively long paths, and paths already at maximum length are also handled.']

