    return 0;
}
```
This code initializes the `SessionManager` with the URL of an external database and multiple authentication APIs, then inserts a new session, validates a session, and removes it from the session data. The library also includes a background task that periodically cleans up expired sessions to maintain session data integrity and prevent memory leaks.']

