The function is designed to be easily extensible, allowing for the addition of new theme formats or services without significant changes to the existing codebase. Additionally, it adheres to clean, maintainable code practices by using modern JavaScript features like async/await and destructuring, while still being compatible with older versions of NodeJS."]

