The `DataCenterManager` class has methods for adding and removing data centers, as well as an inner class called `DataCenter` that represents a single data center. The `DataSynchronizer` class has a method for synchronizing with a remote data center, as well as an inner class called `DataCenter` that represents a single data center. The `DataMonitor` class has a method for monitoring a data center, as well as an inner class called `DataCenter` that represents a single data center.

