            engine_.data_cv().wait(lock, [this] { return !reports_.empty(); });
            for (const auto& report : reports_) {
                if (!engine_.add_report(report)) {
                    // Handle the error here.
                }
            }
            reports_.clear();
        }
    }
};
```
Note that this is just a basic example and may need to be modified depending on your specific use case. Additionally, you will need to implement any necessary error handling and input validation as per your requirements."]

